      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, youre saying it's definitely an erosion of checks and balances? i thought there were actual legal precedents that support a broader privilege to protect the deliberative process. aren't you being a bit one-sided here? help me see why the other side might actually have a legitimate legal footing.",
